    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A racing adventure with quirky physics and asynchronous multiplayer (ghosts). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654200/extras/c819f2f49e0608ecc04222e504514437.avif?t=1747818100\" width=616 height=200 /></span>&gt; Find all the secret passages and break the levels while you are at it.<br>&gt; Join thousands of other players and compete in the daily &amp; weekly event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I you are looking for graphics fidelity then please move on. This one is all about skill. It looks easy at the start, but it's not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HINT: Go watch the top players to learn how to beat the levels by using all sorts of shortcuts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy :-)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A racing adventure with quirky physics and asynchronous multiplayer (ghosts). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654200/extras/c819f2f49e0608ecc04222e504514437.avif?t=1747818100\" width=616 height=200 /></span>&gt; Find all the secret passages and break the levels while you are at it.<br>&gt; Join thousands of other players and compete in the daily &amp; weekly event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I you are looking for graphics fidelity then please move on. This one is all about skill. It looks easy at the start, but it's not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HINT: Go watch the top players to learn how to beat the levels by using all sorts of shortcuts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy :-)</p>",
